<title>USA: 3DO forms venture with Samsung.</title>
<headline>3DO forms venture with Samsung.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 3DO Company said Wednesday it reached an agreement in principle with Samsung Electronics Co Ltd to form a new joint venture company to design and sell semiconductors.</p>
<p>It said Samsung will contribute about $30 million to the new venture, which will focus on delivering high-performance graphics, audio and video devices for use in consumer proudcts.</p>
<p>The venture will concentrate on personal comuter and network computer, logic devices and other home consumer electronics applications.</p>
</text>
